      en: ["Horta was officially granted city status (Cidade) in 1833.", "The modern marina of Horta was inaugurated in 1986.", "The famous 'Peter Cafe Sport' was established on December 25, 1918.", "Horta served as a major station for 15 telegraph cable companies until 1970.", "The Church of São Salvador was completed in 1680 in Baroque style.", "The Monte da Guia protected area provides panoramic views over the city and bay."],
