      en: ["Amadora was officially established as a municipality on September 17, 1979.", "The city was elevated to city status (Cidade) in the same year, 1979.", "Amadora is one of the smallest municipalities in Portugal by land area.", "The Amadora International Comics Festival (Amadora BD) began in 1990.", "The Águas Livres Aqueduct was constructed between 1731 and 1799.", "The Carenque Neolithic Necropolis is a significant local archaeological site."],
