      en: ["Mêda was officially granted city status in 2004.", "The historic village of Marialva is part of the municipality.", "The region is renowned for high-quality olive oil and wine.", "The town is situated at an average altitude of 670 meters.", "Roman coin finds prove early settlement of the area.", "The clock tower of Mêda is a prominent local landmark."],
